# tam-install-font — Install a font package and select its family.
#
#   tam-install-font <display-name> <package> <family>
#
# Ported from Tamlinux 4.0.4 (tam-install-font) for plan 18 0.2.1.
# Changed: owned launcher, package installer, and font setter.
#
# Copyright (c) David Heinemeier Hansson
